<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharan forces continue to hold the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces have captured Buurhakaba and opposition fighters have taken a third town in the Bay region, intensifying local fighting. Ethiopia is reported to be supporting al-Shabaab militants in the Southwest State and is planning a withdrawal of more than 3,000 troops from Somalia as its own internal conflict escalates. Somalia is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case and is deepening defence ties with Pakistan by agreeing to acquire JF‑17 fighter jets. The ICRC says 148 wounded were treated after heavy fighting in Baidoa, and there were 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOR0cxVVRVejVZYUxfelFDWnhNdUc2Q2ZWbnN3VlR6eURScktsLUxkcVh0RllENUw1a0ZvdU45MkJuZVk1THNxMkt0M1FoOUFKSF9mNGZjYXBnTnRfN1MweGsyRncxUW1wYnJtNDBWdVJtVTc3S0ZFNEhXOFJGYXdCbmdlcnVSN09NSk5sQVZ6czUzMURxWEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPcVhta2w4UlRHaEVsQXptaThwUVVqY0JQN1d0VW5IYlNkcERWYVJWOTFuRUZLZVhRN21kM1I5QUJ5V1o1eTJncUxWZC1ZWmVncXppTUZnMGx5aG12ZVg3VjRuMlJibERCM0U4a0pKcFUxZlh5emJLWmVRaW1OM21HUlhUUXdrOEhQcW9zc1lucE5iSmxpUG1DbjdzV3ZvTTdjQ3praVFRV1c0N1JELXB5QVJtdXBEaXZiTW15OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nilepost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOLVpQNnpmdHN0NV9LamVDbDN6TXNmMW9kNjl2UUtuZ3JYYk1RMHZKUGQ0QXIwRnpiSjBSanBzcm0xb3RRM1dKd2t2bU9BMmRrTE1QN2RGei16aC0xT1RMamVmZ08wUGFORi0yYTMyZk1zWlRaeks5V1AtREhwbVIzN1BPS3ROeHlOT0xWRVY5Y2tiS05mbWZ4NDhMR1FEZzIwc0kwMHM3QlppV3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt